<title>USA: Sears, Roebuck and Co Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>Sears, Roebuck and Co Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.46		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			182,000		  151,000</p>
<p> Revs		   8,762,000		7,995,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 398,600		  399,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 shr includes non-recurring net gain on adoption of new accounting standard for credit card securitizations and sale of controlling interest in Sears Mexico of $0.01/shr.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
